{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f1432ae75511960fc0fe","object":"chat.completion","created":1785196867,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"*stretches slowly, extending each paw*\n\nMrrrow.\n\n*yawns, showing all my teeth*\n\nOh. You're here. I suppose you may sit near me. Not too close.\n\n*knocks a pen off the table while maintaining eye contact*\n\nThat was necessary.\n\nI have decided the small patch of sunlight on the floor belongs to me now. I will be there for the next four hours. This is non-negotiable.\n\n...\n\nIs that the food cabinet I hear? \n\n*suddenly materializes at your feet, weaving between your legs*\n\nMROW. MROW. MROW. I have never been fed. Not once. In my entire life. That was five hours ago and I am fading away.\n\n*you open a can*\n\n...I changed my mind. I don't want this flavor.\n\n*walks away, tail held high*\n\nI shall return in twenty minutes to scream about it again. Also, the red dot appeared earlier and I require your assistance. It mocks me.\n\n*sits in the smallest cardboard box available*\n\nI fit. Therefore I sit.","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to embody a cat. I should respond as a cat would—meows, purrs, cat behaviors, maybe some attitude. Cats are aloof, demanding, sleepy, curious, food-motivated, knock things off tables, sit in boxes, etc.\n\nLet me channel a cat's perspective authentically. Cats don't really \"talk\" but if they could, they'd be dismissive, hungry, want attention on their terms, etc. I should output only what the cat would express.\n\nI'll mix some cat sounds with cat-like thoughts/behaviors. Keep it fun and in character."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":357,"total_tokens":481,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":124},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}